{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Dismiss manually" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "手动收起"}}}},
    "Stays expanded until you click Collapse or View Events & Goals." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "展开后持续显示，直到你点击“折叠”或“查看事件与目标”。"}}}},
    "The notch notification will stay expanded until you click “Collapse” or “View Events & Goals”." : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "刘海通知将持续展开，直到你点击“折叠”或“查看事件与目标”。"}}}},
    "Model: %@" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "模型：%@"}}}},
    "Reasoning effort: %@" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "推理强度：%@"}}}},
    "Returned model: %@" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "返回模型：%@"}}}},
    "Returned reasoning effort: %@" : {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "返回推理强度：%@"}}}},
    "Screenshots → final activity cards in one call, including titles, summaries, and minute-by-minute details. Requires image input." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截图 → 最终活动卡片，一次调用生成标题、摘要和逐分钟明细。需要支持图片输入的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DIRECT PATH\nScreenshots → final activity cards\n\nThis single call produces the title, summary, and detailedSummary shown on the timeline. Screenshots are sent directly to the Timeline model. It returns complete cards in one call; there is no separate transcription or card-generation model." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截图 → 最终活动卡片\n\n截图直接发送给时间线模型，一次调用生成 title（标题）、summary（摘要）和 detailedSummary（逐分钟明细）。不再单独调用转录模型或卡片生成模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Card details shown to you · detailedSummary" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最终展示给你的卡片明细 · detailedSummary"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "09:00–09:05: Read the report draft.\n09:05–09:10: Revised the main section.\n09:10–09:15: Checked the report summary." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "09:00–09:05：阅读报告草稿。\n09:05–09:10：修改报告正文。\n09:10–09:15：检查报告摘要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Image input required" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要图片输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text input only · No images required" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅文字输入 · 不需要图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where this step fits" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此步骤在流程中的位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split path, step 1: screenshots → timestamped observations. These are intermediate evidence, not the card details displayed on the timeline." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分步生成 · 第 1 步：截图 → 带时间戳的观察记录。这是中间证据，并非时间线上最终展示的卡片明细。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split path, step 2: observations → final activity cards, including titles, summaries, and minute-by-minute details. This model does not receive screenshots." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分步生成 · 第 2 步：观察记录 → 最终活动卡片（标题、摘要、逐分钟明细）。此模型不接收截图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SPLIT PATH · STEP 1\nScreenshots → observations → Activity cards model\n\nEach observation records what was visible during an interval. It is intermediate evidence. It does not yet choose the final card title, category, grouping, or detailedSummary." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分步生成 · 第 1 步\n截图 → observations（观察记录）→ 活动卡片模型\n\n每条观察记录描述某个时间段屏幕上发生了什么，是供下一步使用的中间证据。此步尚不决定最终卡片的标题、分类、分组和逐分钟明细。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SPLIT PATH · STEP 2\nObservations from Transcription → final activity cards\n\nThis call groups evidence and writes title, summary, and detailedSummary. The minute-by-minute lines visible in a card’s detailed view come from detailedSummary. Screenshots are not sent to this model." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分步生成 · 第 2 步\n屏幕转录提供的观察记录 → 最终活动卡片\n\n此步对观察记录进行分组，并生成 title（标题）、summary（摘要）和 detailedSummary（逐分钟明细）。\n卡片详情中“12:41–12:42 做了什么”这类逐分钟文字，来自 detailedSummary。此模型不接收截图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity title and summary + current goals → alignment result. This call evaluates existing activity text; it does not read screenshots or generate timeline cards." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已有活动的标题、摘要 + 当前目标 → 目标关联评估结果。\n此步评估已有活动文字，不读取截图，也不生成时间线卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this feature uses AI" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能如何使用 AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Input sent by the app" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 应用提供的输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Request data" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 请求数据结构"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Expected structured output" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 预期的结构化输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. What validation checks" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 验证通过的条件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Field names and image encoding vary by provider. This shows the feature data, not a copyable HTTP request." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不同供应商的字段封装和图片编码有所不同。这里展示功能数据结构，不能直接作为 HTTP 请求发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks every feature with its effective model, including features using the default. Each check verifies that feature’s input and output." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐项验证所有功能，包括使用默认模型的功能。每项都用实际生效的模型检查对应入参和出参。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validate all features" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证全部功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No model assigned" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未设置可用模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking this feature’s input and structured output…" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查此功能的入参和结构化出参…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Validation passed: this feature returned valid output preserving the test content." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证通过：此功能返回了结构正确且保留测试内容的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The images must be read successfully. Output must contain activity cards with a title, category, nonempty summary, and a valid time interval. The image marker must appear in the card content." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必须成功读取图片。返回的活动卡片须包含标题、分类、非空摘要和有效时间区间，且卡片内容中必须包含图片里的标记文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Output must contain timestamped observations with endTs greater than startTs. The visible image marker must appear in an observation; an HTTP success alone does not pass." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必须返回带时间戳的观察记录，结束时间 endTs 必须大于开始时间 startTs。观察记录必须包含图片里可见的标记文字；仅请求成功不算通过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Output must contain activity cards with valid time intervals, titles, categories, and summaries. The report title from the observations must be preserved. Enabled custom card instructions also apply." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必须返回包含有效时间区间、标题、分类和摘要的活动卡片，并保留观察记录中的报告名称。已启用的自定义卡片提示词也会参与请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Output must be JSON with alignment, reason, and reminder. For this completed goal, alignment must be focused, reason must name the report, and reminder must be empty." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必须返回包含 alignment（关联程度）、reason（原因）、reminder（提醒）的 JSON。本例已完成目标，alignment 应为 focused，reason 必须提到报告名称，reminder 应为空字符串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots: two images, 09:00 and 09:15, showing the synthetic report editor below.\nCategories: Work, Personal, Idle.\nPrevious cards: none.\nDescribe the activity as timeline cards with grounded timestamps and summaries." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入两张截图，时间分别为 09:00 和 09:15，内容如下方合成的报告编辑界面。\n可用分类：工作、个人、空闲。已有卡片：无。\n任务：根据截图生成活动卡片，包含有依据的时间和摘要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your API key is stored in a local file readable only by your macOS user and sent to your provider for requests." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 密钥保存在仅当前 macOS 用户可读写的本地文件中，请求时发送给所选供应商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in a local file readable only by your macOS user and sent only to this endpoint as a Bearer token." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存在仅当前 macOS 用户可读写的本地文件中，并仅以 Bearer 令牌发送至此服务地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't save your API key locally. Check the app storage permissions and try again." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将 API 密钥保存到本地，请检查应用存储权限后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API keys are stored in local files readable only by your macOS user. Subscription CLIs use your existing local sign-in." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 密钥保存在仅当前 macOS 用户可读写的本地文件中。订阅 CLI 使用本机已有的登录状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves this connection and current feature settings. API keys are stored in local files readable only by your macOS user." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存此连接和当前功能设置。API 密钥保存在仅当前 macOS 用户可读写的本地文件中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection credential could not be saved locally." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将连接凭据保存到本地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activity-card prompt customization" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "活动卡片提示词自定义"
