            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请退出应用后，从访达重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target Flow needs screen recording permission to generate your timeline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Target Flow 需要屏幕录制权限来生成时间线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target Flow stores recordings on your device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Target Flow 将录制内容保存在本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With local AI, analysis can run on your device. If you choose a cloud provider, the data needed for analysis is sent to that provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用本地 AI 时，分析可在设备上进行；选择云端提供商时，分析所需的数据会发送到该提供商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can pause or quit Target Flow at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以随时暂停或关闭 Target Flow。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen recording permission has not been detected yet. Enable it in System Settings. If it is already enabled, click “Quit and Reopen” to apply the permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未检测到录屏权限。请在系统设置中开启；如果开关已开启，点击‘退出并重新打开’让授权生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen & System Audio Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕与系统音频录制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕与系统音频录制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find Target Flow (or TargetFlow) in the list and turn on the switch on the right. Accessibility permission is not required here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在列表中找到 Target Flow（或 TargetFlow），开启右侧开关。这里不需要辅助功能权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it is missing, click + below the list and select the current app:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果没有找到，点击列表下方的 +，选择当前应用："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Target Flow in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在访达中显示 Target Flow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Return to this window after granting permission. If the system asks you to restart, quit and reopen the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权后返回此窗口；若系统要求重新启动，请退出后重新打开应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unable to start the restart helper: %@. Please quit the app and reopen it from Finder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启动重启助手：%@。请退出应用后，从访达重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Event colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "事件颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage events and choose the goals you want to work on now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理具体事件，选择你现在想推进的目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use colors to identify events. Colors do not affect goal evaluation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用颜色辅助识别事件，不影响目标评估。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close Events and Goals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭事件与目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can select multiple current goals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前目标可多选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Describe your events": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "描述具体事件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write down what you want to do and add details, such as fixing a login issue or preparing for an interview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写下你要做的事情和具体说明，例如修复登录问题或准备面试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on “Current goal” below each event. You can select multiple goals. Working on any of them counts as focused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启事件下方的“当前目标”开关，可同时选择多个。推进其中任意一个即为专注。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will receive reminders for neutral or distracting events, and none while focused. Turn off all goals to pause goal evaluation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中性或分心事件会提醒，专注时不提醒。全部关闭即可暂停目标评估。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visual cues": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag onto an event →": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖到事件上 →"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the color wheel above to adjust the palette, then drag colors onto events. Colors are only used as visual cues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动上方色盘调整配色，再将颜色拖到事件上。颜色仅用于辅助识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add event": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加事件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colors are optional and can be changed at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色可选，之后也可以随时修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust colors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add something you want to do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一件要做的事情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New event": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新事件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ", ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI did not return a valid goal assessment. Please try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 未返回有效的目标评估，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API usage & cost": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接口用量与费用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow notifications, banners, and sounds in macOS. Focus mode may silence or hide notifications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 macOS 中允许通知、横幅和声音；专注模式可能静音或隐藏通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies after each new event assessment. The same recording will not trigger repeated reminders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次新事件评估后生效，同一段记录不重复提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Assessing new events": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在评估新事件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
