    "Target Flow uses %@ through your existing %@ subscription. Install it and sign in on this Mac, then we'll verify the connection." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding intro. %1$@ is the CLI tool (Codex CLI or Claude Code); %2$@ is the subscription brand (ChatGPT or Claude). Keep both arguments addressed by index.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
